# The call did not get a quote: the callee's own refusal (code_expired), or
# the engine's (txco_call_invalid_input, txco_call_no_entry, …). Either is
# data under `_quote.error`; the request goes on and answers 422.
WHEN ._quote.ok == false
  EMIT .error = ._quote.error,
       @web.res.status = 422,
       @halt = true
